AmountPerMU [SimTalk] - Portioner
Sets the Amount of the material in liters which the Portioner designated by <Path> is to transmute into
individual MUs.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.AmountPerMU:real
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type real.
Example
MyPortioner.AmountPerMU := 10
See also
Amount per MU [Portioner]
AmountPerMU [SimTalk] - Portioner
Plant Simulation Help 11-2907
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

MUPath [SimTalk]
Sets the type of MU which the Portioner designated by <Path> is to create.
Remarks
You can either use one of the predefined MUs or you can create your own MU for just this purpose.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.MUPath:path
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type path.
Example
MyPortioner.MUPath := .MUs.Container
See also
MU [Portioner]
MUPath [SimTalk]
